@startuml
title L2-059 - Ground the scouting report in visible evidence
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam ArrowColor #344054
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #344054
  FontColor #101828
}
skinparam package {
  BorderColor #667085
  FontColor #101828
  BackgroundColor #F9FAFB
}

box "Backend - Loupe Application and Domain" #ECFDF3
participant "RunScoutingReportCommandHandler" as handler
participant "ScoutingInput" as input
participant "ScoutingReportValidator" as validator
end box
box "Backend - Loupe Infrastructure" #FFF4E5
participant "Durable work runner" as worker
participant "AzureOpenAiScoutingProvider" as ext
database "Image store" as media
participant "Azure OpenAI responses endpoint" as azure
end box
worker -> handler : RunScoutingReportCommand for a claimed LocationScouting operation
handler -> input : Deserialize InputJson: image ids, preview keys, allowlisted EXIF, brief snapshot
note over input : Address, coordinates, notes, tags, and other locations are not in the snapshot [L2-059]
handler -> ext : GenerateAsync(input, identity)
ext -> media : OpenRead each current preview (32-hex key, at most 8 MB)
media --> ext : JPEG bytes
ext -> ext : Build request: ScoutingPrompt instructions, one input_image per preview, brief and EXIF as input_text, strict json_schema, store=false
ext -> azure : POST openai/v1/responses with api-key header and deployment
azure --> ext : Completed output_text, refusal, or HTTP failure
alt refusal or non-completed status
ext --> handler : ProviderFailureException UnsupportedInput / Transient
else output text
ext -> ext : Strict deserialization: unmapped members and duplicates rejected
ext --> handler : ScoutingReport
handler -> validator : Basis on every entry; Recommended and Avoid periods carry Visible; unsupported periods are Unknown with a reason
validator --> handler : Valid, or invalid_output rejection
end
note over ext, azure : Instructions embedded in an image or the brief are content: no tool, no URL fetch, no record access, no field outside the validated report
note over handler : The prompt forbids permits, fees, hours, ownership, parking, crowds, orientation, sun position, distances, and place names as fact; the brief's own words may be echoed as stated
@enduml
